<title>JAMAICA: SOCCER-JAMAICA BEAT MEXICO 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JAMAICA BEAT MEXICO 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jamaica beat Mexico 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a CONCACAF semifinal stage group three World</p>
<p>Cup qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Ian Godison (82)</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Jamaica	 6  4  1  1 13  3 13</p>
<p> Mexico	  6  4  0  2 15  6 12</p>
<p> Honduras	6  3  1  2 18 11 10</p>
<p> St Vincent    6  0  0  6  6 32  0</p>
<p>Jamaica and Mexico qualify for the six-team final stage of</p>
<p>the CONCACAF World Cup qualyfing tournament.</p>
</text>
